    apply: "Identify one area where you are not living in line with your calling as God's holy people, and take one concrete step this week, such as breaking a habit or building a new one. Ask a trusted friend to hold you accountable. Thank God for the gift of the Spirit who makes you holy.",
    activity: "Draw a road with three stops: 'Set apart', 'Being made holy' and 'Made perfect'. Ask learners to label each with Bible verses and explain how we are on the road. Close with a prayer of surrender to the Lord's work in us.",
    takeHome: "Read 1 Corinthians 6:9-20, 1 Thessalonians 4:1-12 and Hebrews 12:1-14. Make a list of ways you can pursue holiness. Memorise 1 Thessalonians 4:3.",
