    teacher: "Discussions of holiness can lead to legalism or to guilt. Emphasise that holiness grows from grace and the Spirit's work. Be sensitive to learners who feel ashamed of past or present struggles. Avoid reducing holiness to a list of external rules; point to the heart.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners to explain the three stages of sanctification and give an example.",
