    sa: ["Name two practical ways you will live and share your salvation after this course.", ["thanks", "testimony", "church", "serve", "invite", "pray"], "Answers vary. Credit specific commitments such as sharing a testimony, inviting a friend to church, daily thanks, regular fellowship or serving others."],
